<view class="page">
  <view class="grid">
    <view class="grid-item" bindtap="onPlaylistsTap">
      <text class="grid-num">{{playlistCount}}</text>
      <text class="grid-label">播放列表</text>
    </view>
    <view class="grid-item">
      <text class="grid-num">{{historyCount}}</text>
      <text class="grid-label">历史记录</text>
    </view>
    <view class="grid-item" bindtap="onDownloadsTap">
      <text class="grid-num">{{downloadCount}}</text>
      <text class="grid-label">下载</text>
    </view>
    <view class="grid-item">
      <text class="grid-num">{{totalListenHours}}</text>
      <text class="grid-label">累计收听(小时)</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice" has:if="{{localNotice}}" bindtap="onLocalNoticeTap">
    <text class="notice-text">
      元服务受系统限制，无法直接扫描手机本地音乐文件。已下载的歌曲可在「下载」中播放。
    </text>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">常听歌曲</text>
    </view>
    <view has:if="{{topSongs.length > 0}}">
      <view
        class="top-row"
        has:for="{{topSongs}}"
        has:key="key"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onTopSongTap"
      >
        <text class="top-index">{{index + 1}}</text>
        <view class="top-info">
          <text class="top-name" max-lines="1">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="top-artist" max-lines="1">{{item.artist}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="top-count">{{item.playCount}}次</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <empty has:else text="多听几首歌，这里会出现你的常听"></empty>
  </view>

  <mini-player id="miniPlayer" bind:open="onOpenPlayer" bind:toggle="onTogglePlayer"></mini-player>
</view>
